{"title": "第八章", "index": 1452, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"IF8SO0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">上善若水，水善利万物而不争，处众人之所恶，故几于道。居善地，心善渊，与善仁，言善信，正善治，事善能，动善时。夫唯不争，故无尤。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}